", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Checks dimensions and file-size limits of every asset: 24 checked, 24 passed, trailer 3.02 MB."}, {"id": "store_assets_report_trailer", "label": "SwiftTill 39-second Trailer", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "store-assets/REPORT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Real screen recording (ffmpeg gdigrab) of the app on Demo Mart data, trimmed and captioned by trailer.py; silent by choice to avoid music licensing risk; ffmpeg from imageio-ffmpeg installed locally into gitignored store-assets/tools."}, {"id": "store_assets_report_feature_audit", "label": "Store Feature Audit (claims vs Store build)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "store-assets/REPORT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Certification checks that listing claims match the app. Pharmacies, cloud backup, custom invoice templates and stock reports are not in the Store build and must be removed or reworded."}, {"id": "store_assets_report_name_casing_inconsistency", "label": "SwiftTill vs Swifttill Name Casing Inconsistency", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "store-assets/REPORT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Artwork says SwiftTill (per brief); the app UI says Swifttill; the Partner Center reservation is swifttill. One spelling must be chosen and artwork regenerated via render.py."}, {"id": "store_assets_report_product_issues_found", "label": "Product Issues Found During Asset Work", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "store-assets/REPORT.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Not fixed (out of scope): PharmacyUser role shown in 